00:01:42.560 --> 00:01:43.760
a little bit of background.

00:01:43.760 --> 00:01:46.570
So I think it's really important
to understand the context

00:01:46.570 --> 00:01:50.680
from which the team emerged to
understand our path to product

00:01:50.680 --> 00:01:51.802
