00:01:51.802 --> 00:01:54.010
So a little bit in the
background and the motivation.

00:01:54.010 --> 00:01:56.380
I'll give you a little
bit better understanding

00:01:56.380 --> 00:02:00.160
of where we sit as a group
within CBS Interactive

00:02:00.160 --> 00:02:04.240
and what we have to work
with in terms of data,

00:02:04.240 --> 00:02:08.500
and the motivation center on
why we use the Google Cloud AI

00:02:08.500 --> 00:02:10.270
