00:02:21.160 --> 00:02:23.980
overview of the architecture
of our components,

00:02:23.980 --> 00:02:27.820
as well as a brief look at
the content processing system

00:02:27.820 --> 00:02:31.840
that integrates with
the Cloud AI products.

00:02:31.840 --> 00:02:35.020
And then Rob will go over
